  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWSUW.ITM~   ~override~

COPY
  ~PF#werefighter/cre/PF#FWFSU.CRE~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/cre/PF#FWLF0.CRE~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/cre/PF#FWPX1.CRE~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/cre/PF#FWPX2.CRE~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/cre/PF#FWPX3.CRE~   ~override~
